        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Promotional Hires – When newly promoted employees have the same promotional hire date, their seniority shall be determined by total bargaining unit seniority. If the affected employees have the same promotional hire date and same total bargaining unit seniority, the employee who will have higher seniority will be established by lottery drawing (i.e., draw a number from a hat with a local Union officer present).",
