            "block_content": "a. Work Schedule Bidding. Each security staff member may submit their bid for a shift and days off work schedule following the posting of the work schedule by the Security Manager. Employees shall have ten (10) working days following the posting of the work schedule to make their bid selections. The employer will post the work schedule for bidding twenty-five (25) calendar days prior to the rotation date.",
